{"t":"NVO","made":"2026-11-26 02:57","name":"Novo Nordisk A/S","ko":"노보노디스크","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - General","employees":68794,"hq":"Bagsvaerd, Denmark","website":"https://www.novonordisk.com","summary_en":"Novo Nordisk A/S, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the research and development, manufacture, and distribution of pharmaceutical products. It operates through two segments, Obesity and Diabetes Care, and Rare Disease. The Obesity and Diabetes care segment provides products for diabetes, obesity, cardiovascular, and other emerging therapy areas. The Rare Disease segment offers products in the areas of rare blood disorders, rare endocrine disorders, and hormone replacement therapy. The company also provides NovoPen 6 and NovoPen Echo Plus, smart insulin pens; Dose Check, an insulin dose guidance application; growth hormone pens and injection needles; and Wegovy pill an oral glucagon-like peptide-1 (GLP-1) receptor agonist therapy for weight management. The company has a collaboration with Anthropic accelerate the development of new medicines and advance AI-driven software development. It operates in Europe, Canada, the United States, Japan, Korea, Oceania, Southeast Asia, Mainland China, Hong Kong and Taiwan, Latin America, the Middle East, and Africa. It has a strategic collaboration with Orbis Medicines to discover and develop oral macrocycle therapeutics for cardiometabolic diseases. The company was formerly known as Novo Industri A/S and changed its name to Novo Nordisk A/S in April 1989. The company was founded in 1923 and is headquartered in Bagsvaerd, Denmark.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Novo Nordisk A/S는 자회사와 함께 의약품의 연구 개발, 제조 및 유통에 참여하고 있습니다. 비만 및 당뇨병 관리와 희귀 질환이라는 두 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 비만 및 당뇨병 관리 부문은 당뇨병, 비만, 심혈관 및 기타 신흥 치료 분야에 대한 제품을 제공합니다. 희귀 질환 부문은 희귀 혈액 질환, 희귀 내분비 질환, 호르몬 대체 요법 분야의 제품을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 또한 스마트 인슐린 펜인 NovoPen 6 및 NovoPen Echo Plus를 제공합니다. 인슐린 투여량 안내 애플리케이션인 Dose Check; 성장 호르몬 펜 및 주사 바늘; Wegovy 알약은 체중 관리를 위한 경구용 글루카곤 유사 펩타이드-1(GLP-1) 수용체 작용제 치료법입니다. 이 회사는 Anthropic과 협력하여 신약 개발을 가속화하고 AI 기반 소프트웨어 개발을 발전시킵니다. 유럽, 캐나다, 미국, 일본, 한국, 오세아니아, 동남아시아, 중국 본토, 홍콩, 대만, 라틴 아메리카, 중동 및 아프리카에서 운영됩니다. Orbis Medicines와 전략적 협력을 통해 심장대사 질환에 대한 경구용 거대고리 치료제를 발굴 및 개발하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Novo Industri A/S로 알려져 있었고 1989년 4월에 Novo Nordisk A/S로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1923년에 설립되었으며 덴마크 Bagvaerd에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":40.915,"mcap":180281507840.0,"pe":10.332071,"fpe":11.648595,"peg":3.957,"ps":0.5403312,"pb":5.5117493,"ev_ebitda":1.464,"div":4.46,"beta":0.368,"hi52":64.16,"lo52":35.12},"fin":{"rev":333650001920.0,"rev_g":0.056,"eps_g":-0.158,"gross":0.83333,"op":0.50778997,"net":0.33921,"roe":0.58384,"fcf":32748875776.0,"cash":46351998976.0,"debt":134480003072.0,"de":61.744,"eps":3.96,"feps":3.512441},"own":{"short":0.0128,"inst":0.10226,"insider":3.0000001e-05},"analyst":{"n":12,"mean":45.744484,"median":43.712677,"high":64.04064,"low":39.409603,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.84615,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":40.0,"priorPriceTarget":47.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-11","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":40.0,"priorPriceTarget":40.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-03-02","Firm":"Goldman Sachs","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":41.0,"priorPriceTarget":63.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-02-24","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Overweight","